
>> shop := (Papakupu hou
	tuku: ['magazine'] kei: ['books'],
	tuku: ['computer'] kei: ['electronics'],
	tuku: ['lipstick'] kei: ['cosmetics']
).
Huaputa tuhi: (shop kei-a-ia: ['computer']), rārangi-hou. 
Huaputa tuhi: (shop kei-a-ia: ['sausage']), rārangi-hou. 
Huaputa tuhi: (shop kei-a-ia: ['computers']), rārangi-hou. 
Huaputa tuhi: (shop kei-a-ia: ['compute']), rārangi-hou. 
Huaputa tuhi: (shop kei-a-ia: ['2computer']), rārangi-hou. 
